  abstract = {A large-scale analysis of the ICLR 2024 and 2025 peer review, before and after rebuttal. Combining score statistics with LLM-based analysis of reviews and rebuttals, we find that initial scores and co-reviewers' ratings best predict score changes, and that rebuttals matter most for borderline papers. We derive practical advice for authors and for designing fairer review processes.}
}

